===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*leyp-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|elleven}}, {{m|enm|enleven}}, {{m|enm|eleven}}, from {{inh|en|ang|endleofan}}; from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*ainalif||one left}} (i.e., one left over after having already counted to ten), a compound of {{m|gem-pro|*ainaz}} and {{m|gem-pro|*-lif}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*leyp-||leave, remain}}. Compare {{cog|fy|alve}}, {{cog|nds|ölven}}, {{cog|nl|elf}}, {{cog|de|elf}}, {{cog|is|ellefu}}, {{cog|da|-}} and {{cog|no|elleve}}.

